- Persistent PTYs across server restart.
- Rate limiting.
- Sandboxing (chroot/jail/container).
- Sharing / teams / mentions / cross-user features.
- Offline mode (but react-query laid down so it's reachable later).
- Reverse migration (remote → local).
- Cross-server migration (remote → remote).
- CLI-based migration command (in-app wizard instead).
- REST/plain HTTP transport (tRPC only).
- Spawned child process for local server (embedded only).

